<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 139 0 R
/E (NestSync is a full-stack Roommate Management System designed to simplify shared living by integrating expense management, chore coordination, shared scheduling, and communication into a single platform. The system enables roommates to manage finances, responsibilities, and household activities efficiently, reducing conflicts and improving transparency.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
