168 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 139 0 R
/E (As students and working professionals often live with roommates, managing shared expenses, chores, and communication can become complex and lead to misunderstandings. Existing solutions like Splitwise focus only on financial tracking and lack holistic household management features. NestSync addresses this gap by providing an all-in-one solution for co-living coordination.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
